    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00016",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "早晨没让你帮忙解小手，我直哼哼，等着你呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This morning, when you did not help me relieve myself, I kept groaning and waiting for you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00016",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "现在又想朝西翻身，我难过得直哼哼啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now I want to turn over toward the west again, and I am groaning because it hurts so much.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00016",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "让我面朝西吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Let me face west, please.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00016",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "喂，喂！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, hey!”",
